WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.113
[Low strings as the order is given]

00:01.133 --> 00:02.380
[Rotor blades turn as the squad moves]

00:02.400 --> 00:04.480
[Tank tracks approach along the village road]

00:04.500 --> 00:05.480
[Tank cannon fires]

00:05.500 --> 00:07.180
[Fire cracks beside the trench]

00:07.200 --> 00:08.280
[Distant fire at the mortar pit]

00:08.300 --> 00:09.947
[Mortar bursts across the trench line]

00:09.967 --> 00:12.680
[Helicopter rotors over the suspended vehicle]

00:12.700 --> 00:15.080
[Boats approach the shore]

00:15.100 --> 00:16.480
[Surf as the squad runs ashore]

00:16.500 --> 00:18.413
[Patrol ship fires as a boat passes]

00:18.433 --> 00:20.713
[Jet engines climb over the harbour]

00:20.733 --> 00:23.980
[Impacts roll across the water]
